DESCRIPTION >
    Flat reverse evidence index from the fixed BigQuery identity snapshot. One row
    links one normalized identifier to one live logical fact.

SCHEMA >
    `tenant_id` LowCardinality(String) `json:$.tenant_id`,
    `identifier_key` String `json:$.identifier_key`,
    `fact_key` String `json:$.fact_key`,
    `base_batch_version` UInt64 `json:$.base_batch_version`,
    `committed_at` DateTime64(6) `json:$.committed_at`,
    `row_hash` FixedString(64) `json:$.row_hash`

ENGINE MergeTree
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY tenant_id, identifier_key, fact_key

IMPORT_CONNECTION_NAME boom_bigquery_gcs
IMPORT_BUCKET_URI gs://booming-data/tinybird/migration_seed/identity_fact_evidence/snapshot_at=20260826230500/*.parquet
IMPORT_SCHEDULE @on-demand
IMPORT_FORMAT parquet
